        "description": "Label for sdSlowDnsWhyItMatters"
    },
    "sdSlowDnsHowToFix1": "DNS ya cîhaz an routera xwe bibin resolvereke giştî ya zû — 1.1.1.1 (Cloudflare), 8.8.8.8 (Google), an 9.9.9.9 (Quad9).",
    "@sdSlowDnsHowToFix1": {
